{"chapter-slug":"rw8-31","paragraph":404,"wording":"[Mathematician]","event":"named","holder-quote":"So, after breakfast, Merish went to find Yelroan. The [Mathematician] was in his tent as usual, and Merish poked his head in, took one look at the yawning Gnoll, and came back with some tea and meat biscuits from a nearby campfire.","id":"56a0d3bb-9c97-5c8f-9cfb-a8c0975464e8"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-31","paragraph":560,"wording":"[Mathematician]","event":"named","holder-quote":"Merish saw a scrying orb held by a [Shaman], a group of the Plain’s Eye’s best magic-users…and Yelroan. The [Mathematician] blinked at Merish, and then waved. Xherw gave Merish a slight grin.","id":"5a0ed0b4-8fe2-5b00-82b7-1b464f16d929"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-31","paragraph":608,"wording":"[Mathematician]","event":"named","holder-quote":"“So you say. You know where they are then, Yelroan?”","id":"16497c5e-10ca-5b1d-b4b7-e177c595f39e"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-30","paragraph":425,"wording":"[Mathematician]","event":"named","holder-slug":"yelroan","holder-quote":"The one, the only, the unique [Mathematician] of the Plain’s Eye Tribe embraced Merish hard.","id":"03311209-58ec-5a6a-8bbd-289c592bd1ac"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-30","paragraph":429,"wording":"[Mathematician]","event":"named","holder-slug":"yelroan","holder-quote":"The [Mathematician] gave him a sly look and pushed his glasses up. Somehow, they caught the light and blinded Merish with an afterimage.","id":"4ec99fc0-a10c-5e7d-ac5a-795a84af093e"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-30","paragraph":433,"wording":"[Mathematician]","event":"named","holder-slug":"yelroan","holder-quote":"Yelroan was the most interesting Gnoll that Merish knew. A [Mathematician], a class so rare that even city-people didn’t know what it was.","id":"cee892f6-1fa5-525f-8a70-8c984a5704cd"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-30","paragraph":443,"wording":"[Mathematician]","event":"named","holder-slug":"yelroan","holder-quote":"It did indeed. Yelroan hadn’t gained the [Mathematician] class at first. He’d become a [Scribe], an [Accountant]…then, as he was appointed to calculating the entire clan’s income, managing supplies, and such, he’d morphed into the [Mathematician] class, rather than [Administrator] or some reasonable class.","id":"8e929afa-658d-5ccf-8aa1-f480513cfa12"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw8-30","paragraph":443,"wording":"[Mathematician]","event":"named","holder-slug":"yelroan","holder-quote":"It did indeed. Yelroan hadn’t gained the [Mathematician] class at first. He’d become a [Scribe], an [Accountant]…then, as he was appointed to calculating the entire clan’s income, managing supplies, and such, he’d morphed into the [Mathematician] class, rather than [Administrator] or some reasonable class.","id":"a191761e-2224-5511-a772-a5c9c2283c9f"}
